    {
      "position": 5,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "等価 is often a mathematic terminology or something of equivalent value.\n同等 is often used to \"something that can be substituted, e.g., 一等賞または同等品=The first prize or a substitute.\n均等 is often used to indicate substantive equivalence in terms of purpose, use, characteristics, etc. 均等論=Theory of equivalents, often used in patent infringement cases.",
